            "review_title": "Review at Emoji Pizza",
            "review_text": "TroyNguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nChicken & mushroom was best pizza I've ever had!\nNov 2019\nHidden gem. I ordered the Chicken & Mushroom pizza (209 vnd) and the Durian pizza (253 vnd). The Chicken and Mushroom was exquisite. One of the best pizzas I've ever had. Crust was perfect. Pizza was not too oily. Chicken was tender and soft. Their website says they source all ingredients fresh from the countryside and use organic produce. \nSimilar to 4P's there is an oven where you can see your pizza being prepared.\nUnlike 4P's there was not a long wait. It is not well known to tourists but this restaurant has rave reviews on local websites. \nThe staff were extremely attentive and very friendly. They offered to reheat my pizza as I'd done some filming before eating. There is also a phone number to make reservations and they will send you a confirmation sms if you want to make sure of a spot.\nThey also have a free VIP program where you can receive discounts with repeat visits. It is in a little alley so may be hard to find for first time visitors but it's a nice cosy location with ample parking. The interior is very nice with a peaceful ambience. The bike attendant is also friendly.\nOverall a must try place for pizza fans in HCMC.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 22, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
